OL,3,GNEWSAHealth warning issued as
OL,4,Atemperatures to plummet
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome people's health could be at risk
OL,7,Fas temperatures plummet, the UK Health
OL,8,FSecurity Agency (UKHSA) has warned.
OL,10,FIt has issued a yellow cold health
OL,11,Falert for the North West and West
OL,12,FMidlands from 09:00 GMT on Thursday
OL,13,Funtil 12:00 on Saturday.
OL,15,FIt warned that the cold conditions
OL,16,Fcould have a "serious impact" on people
OL,17,Fwith health problems.
OL,19,FTemperatures could fall as low as -1C
OL,20,F(30F) in Chester, and Barnoldswick in
OL,21,FLancashire on Friday morning.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
